OL,3,GNEWSAMetro extension would 'cut suburb
OL,4,Ain half'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an extension to the Tyne and
OL,7,FWear Metro will cut a suburb and its
OL,8,Fcommunity in half, fearful residents
OL,9,Fhave claimed.
OL,11,FThe #900m scheme to add a line through
OL,12,FWashington, near Sunderland, was
OL,13,Funveiled in June 2025 and it is hoped
OL,14,Ftrains will start running along it in
OL,15,F2033.
OL,17,FJames Murtha, who lives near the
OL,18,Fextension in South Hylton, called the
OL,19,Fplans "absolutely crazy", while Elaine
OL,20,FYoung said the plan "is completely
OL,21,Fdestroying South Hylton".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
