OL,3,GNEWSAMetro extension would 'cut suburb
OL,4,Ain half'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a consultation event, Tom Hardwick,
OL,7,Fhead of system development at Metro
OL,8,Foperator Nexus said the firm was "here
OL,9,Fto listen" and respond to local
OL,10,Ffeedback before final designs are put
OL,11,Fin place.
